note SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
note o4cmd for x86efi: v4.om needs the Linux host words mapnew, mapget, mapset, fork and waitpid,
note which the UEFI backend does not have, so every v4 command (init4, train4, eval4, sample4,
note tune4, gcheck4, ropeck, kvck) and any other unknown command refuses with exit 2 here.
fn o4cmd w ulong to int
exit 2
end
